# CarWash Hub API - requests for the Visual Studio / Rider HTTP client.
# The keys below are the dev-only keys from appsettings.Development.json; they are refused in every
# other environment.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5180
@secretKey = dev-only-ingest-key-0123456789abcdef
@readKey = dev-only-read-key-0123456789abcdefgh

### Push a status - data as a JSON object
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machine-messages
client-secret-key: {{secretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"machineId":"CW-RUH-0001","data":{"status":"Idle","coins":12,"temperatureC":41.5}}

### Push a status - data as a JSON string (stored unescaped)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machine-messages
client-secret-key: {{secretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"machineId":"CW-RUH-0002","data":"{\"status\":\"Washing\",\"program\":\"Foam\"}"}

### Missing machineId, Arabic error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machine-messages
client-secret-key: {{secretKey}}
X-Lang: ar
Content-Type: application/json

{"data":{"status":"Idle"}}

### Latest status of a machine
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machines/CW-RUH-0001/messages/latest
client-read-key: {{readKey}}

### History, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machines/CW-RUH-0001/messages?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
client-read-key: {{readKey}}

### All machines, most recently seen first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machines?sortBy=lastSeenAt&sortDirection=Descending
client-read-key: {{readKey}}
